`HΓ_M=Γ_Mω`; filter compatibility gives
`χ_i(ω-ωχ̃_i)=0`; finite range plus rapid kernel decay preserves almost
locality.  This is named computation **ACE-filter**.

**⟨2⟩3. QED.**

