**ASSUME.** ⟨1⟩5--⟨1⟩6.

**PROVE.** The conclusions of (A2M.2), including the ML2 anchor.

**⟨2⟩1. [VERBATIM PORT — `ansatz-scattering.md` ⟨1⟩6.⟨2⟩4]** Replacing `t`
