+
+*Justification.*  ⟨1⟩5--⟨1⟩6 and D24(d)1--5.
+
+**⟨2⟩3.**  Therefore the lane status is **PARTIAL**, not
+`PROVED-candidate`.
+
+*Justification.*  PRD.md goal 2 and the blitz rules' honest-label contract.
+
+**⟨2⟩4. QED.**
