+
+### ⟨1⟩3. Exact LSZ-shaped scalar factorisation of every actual separated limit point
+
+**ASSUME.**  An actual row-measure limit point `mu_{*,epsilon}` of
+`(D29-HS-SEP)` along the same outer indices as claim
